ExecStart binary:  /Users/dev/.local/bin/mcremote
Plist:             /Users/dev/Library/LaunchAgents/com.maccavelli.mcremote.plist
Label:             com.maccavelli.mcremote
Scope:             launchd-agent (session — stops on logout)
Config:            /Users/dev/.config/mcremote/config.yaml (default written)
                   Edit this file, then: launchctl kickstart -k gui/501/com.maccavelli.mcremote
Enabled:           yes (launchctl enable)
Started:           yes (bootstrap + kickstart)
Linger:            n/a on macOS (LaunchAgent is session-bound; no sudo system daemon)
Logs dir:          /Users/dev/Library/Logs/mcremote

Note: setup-service does not install the binary.
      Install/update it with: make install
Note: macOS 13+ may show a Background Items notification;
      System Settings → General → Login Items can disable the agent.

Status:  launchctl print gui/501/com.maccavelli.mcremote
Logs:    tail -f /Users/dev/Library/Logs/mcremote/mcremote.err.log
Stop:    launchctl bootout gui/501/com.maccavelli.mcremote
Remove:  mcremote setup-service --remove
